==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is similar to the other [[Sniper Cat (Easy)|Sniper Cat]] stages, but this time there are 400% buffed enemies and a Mooth as the boss. Use some Level 20 Basic Cats to complete this stage. If you're having trouble with the Mooth, use some tanky attackers ([[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]]) or use [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-floating]] units ([[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] or [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necromancer Cat]]).

